amily Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Once you were but a humble Mushroom farmer. A Voice called to you. Something from deep below. Now harvest season has come and you know what you must do.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fungal Colony Sim 2 is a reimagining of the original using all the skills I've gained in the years since making it. Harvest mushrooms by sweeping your axe across the land, reinvest those mushrooms back into your hivemind and grow larger! Reach new areas to gather new types of mushrooms!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New in FCS2:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D rendering!</strong> We added a whole third dimension. No more PNGs with faked depth!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Less clicking!</strong> We really weren't happy with the volume of clicking in the first game, and this one has taken a minimalistic approach to the interface</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Massive Upgrade Tree!</strong> We reimagined the way upgrades are done to be more understandable and interactive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple zones!</strong> Unlock new biomes to explore as you progress, and find new types of mushrooms to upgrade yourself with!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And much more!</strong> This is a complete reimagining from the ground up, and I can't explain it all here!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Skylor Beck"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947310/688e7b9a921ff36c3b742ad87de9dd9e47c2c476/header.jpg?t=1774219682","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_re